From: pista-linux contributors <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] media: camss, i2c: add SM8750 MIPI C-PHY 3-trio, Sony IMX906, and Sony IMX882 support

Add native SM8750 CSIPHY v2.3.0 3-trio MIPI C-PHY support and CSID 980
C-PHY RX selection to qcom-camss, and add V4L2 subdev drivers for the
Realme GT7 Pro rear 50MP main wide (Sony IMX906) and rear 50MP 3x
periscope telephoto (Sony IMX882 / LYT-600) C-PHY sensors.

Signed-off-by: pista-linux contributors <noreply@github.com>
---
